'''Cinematic Damage''' is a hidden, unique damage type which has no [[Damage Type Modifier|damage modifier]] against any [[Factions|faction]]. This damage type applies to [[health]], [[shield]] and [[overguard]], and bypasses armor's [[Damage Reduction|damage reduction]]. It is applied as the [[Status Effect|status effect]] of {{D|Slash}} Damage.

==Mechanics==
*Bypasses armor's [[Damage Reduction|damage reduction]].
**Does not bypass [[Damage Reduction|damage reduction]] provided by sources that are not armor.
*Is not increased by buffs to physical or elemental damage.
*[[Sentient]] enemies do not adapt to Cinematic Damage.

==Status Effects ==
Cinematic Damage does not possess any applicable status procs on its own.

== Notes== 
*The term "Cinematic Damage" is in reference to the internal damage type name <code>DT_CINEMATIC_DAMAGE</code>.
**Prior to its discovery, the term "Finishing Damage" was used, often leading to confusion with [[Finisher]] attacks.

